# Packages / lock files (optional depending on preference)
# Packages/manifest.json is usually tracked, keep it.
# /Packages/packages-lock.json can be ignored if you don't want lockfile in git.
# /ProjectSettings/ProjectVersion.txt is usually tracked.

# Unity generated meta files are usually tracked, so do not ignore .meta by default.
# Keep them if you want Unity scene/assets metadata under version control.

# Secrets / env
*.env
.env*
secrets.json
apikeys.txt

# Build output
[Ll]egacyBuilds/
[Ll]egacyBuild/

# Optional: ignore generated asset caches
[Ll]ibrary/PackageCache/
[Ll]ibrary/SourceAssetDB/
[Ll]ibrary/ScriptAssemblies/
